{"page":241,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:44","surah":12,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟ أَضْغَـٰثُ أَحْلَـٰمٍ ۖ وَمَا نَحْنُ بِتَأْوِيلِ ٱلْأَحْلَـٰمِ بِعَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘These are confusing dreams and we are not skilled at dream-interpretation,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَضْغَـٰثُ","en_gloss":"Confused","transliteration":"aḍghāthu","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحْلَـٰمٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"dreams","transliteration":"aḥlāmin","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَحْنُ","en_gloss":"we","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِتَأْوِيلِ","en_gloss":"(are) in the interpretation","transliteration":"bitawīli","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَحْلَـٰمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the dreams","transliteration":"l-aḥlāmi","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِعَـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"learned","transliteration":"biʿālimīna","verse_key":"12:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:44"}]},{"verse_key":"12:45","surah":12,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِى نَجَا مِنْهُمَا وَٱدَّكَرَ بَعْدَ أُمَّةٍ أَنَا۠ أُنَبِّئُكُم بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦ فَأَرْسِلُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but the prisoner who had been freed at last remembered [Joseph] and said, ‘I shall tell you what this means. Give me leave to go.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"But said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"12:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"12:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَجَا","en_gloss":"was saved","transliteration":"najā","verse_key":"12:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنْهُمَا","en_gloss":"of the two","transliteration":"min'humā","verse_key":"12:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱدَّكَرَ","en_gloss":"and remembered","transliteration":"wa-iddakara","verse_key":"12:45"},{"